      "x": 44,
      "y": 298,
      "width": 330,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Aggression in open space. You cannot\nsay where the idea is wrong, so you\ncannot size the trade.",
