      "y": 430,
      "width": 330,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "\"I wasn't quick on the trigger active\nat all\" — 04-24 @00:33",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:54:39.305Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T18:54:39.305Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "p_foot",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 496,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "The arrow never changes. Only the chart underneath it does — and that is what decides whether there is a trade.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T18:54:39.305Z",
